WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.666
They take it so seriously
他们对待赛车非常认真

00:00:01.666 --> 00:00:03.133
Whereas in Europe and in America
而在欧洲和美国

00:00:03.133 --> 00:00:05.366
You get they're all part of a lifestyle
对很多人来说，赛车更多是一种生活方式

00:00:05.366 --> 00:00:07.533
They want to live the experience of being a racing driver
他们想体验赛车手的生活

00:00:07.533 --> 00:00:08.666
They want to wear the right watch
他们想戴对手表

00:00:08.666 --> 00:00:10.333
They want to hang out with the right drivers
和圈子里的车手来往

00:00:10.333 --> 00:00:11.666
They wanna dine well
享用美食

00:00:11.666 --> 00:00:13.733
And they want to have a cool life
过一种很酷的生活

00:00:13.733 --> 00:00:17.000
The drivers here take it so much more seriously
但这里的车手对比赛要认真得多

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:18.133
Every single session
每一节比赛结束后

00:00:18.133 --> 00:00:20.233
the AM drivers are looking at the lap times
AM车手在看圈速

00:00:20.233 --> 00:00:21.400
Looking at the data
分析数据

00:00:21.400 --> 00:00:22.133
Trying to figure out
努力弄清楚

00:00:22.133 --> 00:00:25.000
where they can get their throttle inputs a little bit more accurately
在哪些地方能让油门控制得更精准一些

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:27.000
They're watching every championship around the world
他们会关注世界各地的各种锦标赛

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:28.733
as well other gt championships
包括其他GT赛事

00:00:28.733 --> 00:00:31.366
to try and figure out how to get better at their craft
努力钻研如何进一步提升自己的驾驶技术

00:00:31.366 --> 00:00:34.966
And none are more so in that category then Wang Yibo
在这类车手中，王一博尤其如此

00:00:34.966 --> 00:00:39.900
He literally has gone from being a driver who was getting used to the sport twelve months ago
就在一年前，他还只是一名尚在适应赛事的车手，如今已然蜕变

00:00:39.900 --> 00:00:43.200
   to eating、breathing、sleeping motorsport
吃饭、呼吸和睡眠仿佛全都围绕着赛车

00:00:43.200 --> 00:00:44.866
He is absolutely addicted
他绝对上瘾了

00:00:44.866 --> 00:00:46.600
And he wants to win this championship
而且他想赢得这项锦标赛

00:00:46.600 --> 00:00:48.600
Whether it's this year or whether it's next year
无论是在今年还是明年

00:00:48.600 --> 00:00:50.800
He is absolutely determined and resolute
他的决心都无比坚定

00:00:50.800 --> 00:00:53.500
He wants to be a champion in China GT
他想成为China GT的冠军

00:00:53.500 --> 00:00:55.466
So as the fans make their noise in the stands
看台上的车迷仍在呐喊

00:00:55.466 --> 00:00:57.666
We get ourselves ready for the next encounter
而我们也准备迎接下一场较量

00:00:57.666 --> 00:01:01.466
Which is the second of the qualifying sessions
也就是第二节排位赛

00:01:01.466 --> 00:01:02.800
And the battle really is raging
赛场上的争夺正愈演愈烈